The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository only.

The face model the app uses (InsightFace "buffalo_l") is NOT part of this
repository and is not distributed with it or with the app download. The app
fetches it from InsightFace, once, after the user agrees. It has its own
licence from InsightFace, which states that its pretrained models are
available for non-commercial research purposes only. See
https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface#license and read it before use.
The MIT licence above does not extend to that model.

The text-search model (CLIP) is downloaded separately on first use and has
its own licence, which is not covered here.

